+A new :meth:`~falcon.App.set_error_reporter` method was added to both the WSGI
+and ASGI app classes. The reporter, a plain synchronous callable
+``reporter(req, ex, params, handled)``, is notified of every exception passed to
+the app's error handling (including :class:`~falcon.HTTPError` and
+:class:`~falcon.HTTPStatus` instances), as well as of exceptions raised by error
+handlers, the error serializer, or while starting the response, so that they
+can be logged or sent to an error tracker.
